   {
    "h": "Distribution",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "It is found in southern Myanmar, Thailand (Ramri, Phang Nga Province, Bangnon, Ranong Province), Pegu, Western Malaysia, Johor: Pulau Sibu; India and Bangladesh. The type locality is from Pegu, Myanmar."
